WEBVTT

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.830
All units, stay put.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.330
We grab him when he flips off the engine.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.540
Once in a while, O'Neill's tips
actually come in handy.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.580
I'm tired of waiting, Kei.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.580
Let's finish this up and go home.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:33.370
We're not here on a shopping trip.
This isn't that easy.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.580
Shopping is a lot harder than this.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.160
Doreany shops have far too many things for sale.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.790
You've been here four months.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.080
Get used to it already, country girl.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.410
Country girl?

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:47.200
My Narma is a major city, you know.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.540
Just shut up--

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:52.450
The target's spotted us!
The target's spotted us!

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:54.750
He's getting away!

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.700
All units, head in!

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.160
Grab the target!

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.080
Can we use our guns?

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.410
No!

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:01.950
Do not use your weapons!

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:03.790
Block off the runway with your cars!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.080
Leave it to me!

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.160
What?

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.000
Hey!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.500
Shield of law, protection of the war god!

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:14.790
Stop!

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.750
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.330
Hey, what the hell were you thinking?

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.500
Just watch.

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:43.200
Behold the strength of vaifaht steel.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.250
Moron.

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:50.540
Fifteen years ago, a hyperspace gate
appeared in the middle of the Pacific.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:55.910
Beyond the gate lay a strange world
filled with fairies and monsters.

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:58.200
Kariaena Island. The city of San-Teresa.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:01.500
This city is Earth's "front door."

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.080
Over two million citizens
from this other world live here.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:08.580
A mixture of different races and
diverse cultures, haves and have-nots...

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:12.120
The world's newest "city of dreams."

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:16.330
But in the shadows of all this chaos
lurked countless crimes.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:19.450
Drugs. Prostitution. Weapons smuggling.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.410
The San-Teresa Metropolitan Police maintained

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.450
a special unit to deal with these crimes.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:08.540
Two hours in the mud and we didn't find the guy.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.540
If only a certain idiot hadn't brought
the plane down into a swamp...

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:15.040
Hey, are you referring to me?

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.120
Is this the smuggled goods?

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:21.200
It's all junk.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:25.250
What's up?

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.410
I smell latena.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.660
Hey, don't touch that without permission.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.370
Who are you?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:37.250
Officer Hellmandes with the CBP,
Customs and Border Protection.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.290
I don't need your permission.

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:41.870
We're the ones running this case--

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:44.660
You, the ones who let your target get away?

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:46.410
We'll take over here.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:49.910
We haven't even made a list
of what we've found yet.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:52.950
So you're refusing a request from the CBP?

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:55.700
Of course not!

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:59.540
It'll just take a little time.
Give us some time.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.410
Do it as fast as possible.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.330
Who's that rude man?

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:10.910
An elite investigator on his way
to the top, I guess.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.790
This is part of the job.
Take a look at it when we get home.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.790
You should be able to get it done tonight.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:23.950
No fair, Kei!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.200
I'm supposed to take a bath first today!

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:29.040
It's past midnight so it's a new day!
I'm first!

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.750
Rakebye! That's not how it works!

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:36.290
Don't you doreany always
talk about "ladies first"?

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:38.000
Are you listening, Kei?

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:46.580
Night!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.750
Dummy.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.750
Oh, when you're out of the bath,
sort through that stuff we found.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.620
I'm going to bed.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:01.040
You're the only one who
can smell that stuff, right?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:06.080
And who was it who was snoring
next to me as I drove home?

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:09.200
S-Snoring? I don't...

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:13.830
We need to put that stuff into the
evidence lockers by 11:00 AM tomorrow.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.790
Got it? Goodnight!

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:04.250
Kei is a rude boor!
Everything he does and says makes me so mad!

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.080
Don't you think so too?

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:08.500
Right?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:12.950
He doesn't know how to treat a lady.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:18.950
You're a lady too, so I believe
you understand my frustration, but...

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:24.790
I thought I smelled strong latena.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.370
Hey, Kuroi! That's bad manners!

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:33.620
Kuroi, you're being a bad girl. Get off--

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.410
Hey! Wait! Kuroi!

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:41.950
Oww!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.160
What's this?

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.950
Kei...

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:26.290
Kuroi, it's too early in the morning...

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.330
What the heck?

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.750
Are you still asleep? Your bed is downstairs!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.080
Kei!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.750
Tilarna? Hello?

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:52.160
Knock it off--

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.660
Wh-What is going on?

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:05.370
K-Kuroi!

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:14.160
You too? What is going on?

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:17.080
We're late!

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.200
Hey, Tilarna! We need to get going!

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.450
What are you doing?

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:36.620
Are you not feeling well?

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.330
I won't know if you don't tell me.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:49.080
I know. I know. You need food. Hang on.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.620
Okay, stay home today.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:54.750
I'll tell the chief you've got some
kind of special alien disease.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.370
Get some sleep, okay?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.540
Oh, right! The garbage!

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.370
She left all this out? Jeez.

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:21.830
Kuroi, take care of Tilarna. Be a good girl.

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.750
This is terrible...

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:39.200
That bow had a mildey of Moz Nel Valva on it...

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:49.790
She got on top of Kei
wearing practically nothing!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.700
She's like an animal!

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:59.410
Calm down. That's right. Calm down.

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:01.450
First, that crossbow.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:05.580
It fell off the sofa and into
the garbage can next to it...

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:11.330
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.000
Quenishuba...

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.620
Quenishuba!

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:22.040
Oh, no... Oh, no!

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:33.700
Is she... don't tell me...

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.660
Stop it, Kuroi!

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:40.950
At least... at least take off your underwear!

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:47.000
No! No! No...

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.620
No!

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.450
A simple raid ended up with a plane crash?

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.830
What the hell happened?

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.830
Just like I said.

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.700
The local cops screwed up, and...

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:06.750
Shut up!

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:10.250
The Golanbiza county police were
on the phone screaming at me!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.080
At midnight!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.200
My wife was pissed!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:16.160
Right after I spent the last few days

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:19.080
eating oysters and taking zinc supplements, too!

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:23.870
Chief, was it just the county police?

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:24.870
What?

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:28.200
The complaints you were getting.
Nothing from the CBP?

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.450
The CBP?

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.910
I talked to their guy Hellmandes this morning,

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.790
but he didn't really say anything.

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.200
What?

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:41.250
Hey! You got into some kind of fight
with the CBP, didn't you?

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:43.410
Tell me the truth, Matoba! If you did--

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:46.540
Really, there was nothing! We'll talk later.

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:48.450
Hey, Matoba! Wait!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.410
She's still asleep?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:11.000
I can't take anymore...

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.450
I need to do something.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.160
First, that crossbow.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.870
The trash gets picked up in the afternoon.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:19.450
It should still be in the dumpster.

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:24.580
But I can't get out of this locked
room in the form of a cat!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.330
I need help!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:43.000
Tilarna? She almost never texts me.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:50.250
Dear Cecil. I have a serious problem.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:54.040
Please come to my home as soon
as you can. It's an emergency!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.410
What happened?

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:02.200
"Don't tell Kei"?

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.250
Okay, thanks, guys.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.120
Who the hell is Tilarna talking to?

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.120
Hello? Tilarna?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.120
I saw your text. What's going on?

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:33.540
Hello, kitty! No, I want to talk to Tilarna!

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:36.330
You don't understand what I'm saying, do you?

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:39.370
Anyway, I'm heading over.

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.200
Be a good girl, okay?

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:52.870
Hello?

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.000
What the hell is going on?!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.370
With what?

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:59.580
When I was there yesterday,
there were 28 Semanian items found!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.870
And now I've only got 27!

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:03.700
One is missing!

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.830
Oh, I see.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.870
That's strange.

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:12.410
Well, it happens, right?
Things were a mess yesterday.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:16.950
Get me the missing one now,
before I get you arrested for embezzlement!

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:20.330
Come on. It's just a minor screw-up!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:22.500
Calm the hell down.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.790
Well...

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.160
Just get it to me now! Got it?

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.790
What the hell is his problem?

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:55.500
Tilarna? Are you there?

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:59.250
Is she not home? Tilarna?

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.250
Jeez...

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.700
I'm coming inside!

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.370
Tilarna?

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:29.620
Hey! What's going on?

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.370
You did this, didn't you?

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:38.080
Are you telling me you didn't do it?

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.410
What?

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:50.450
I know this is impossible, but...
are you Tilarna?

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.950
No way...

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:55.540
You really are...

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:58.450
A mildey did this?

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:03.790
You need the crossbow back?

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:07.700
The tool that caused this?

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:10.410
It's in the dumpster outside?

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.290
Why would you put something so important there?

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.830
The trash truck?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:18.790
They'll take the trash away!

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:25.330
Without that bow,
you may not be able to turn back?

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.410
Oh, no!

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:33.750
Ce... Ce!

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:36.580
If you're Tilarna, then...

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:37.580
Ce!

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:39.450
Hey!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.410
Hello?

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:57.790
It's me, Matoba.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.620
Is O'Neill in?

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:03.410
I heard he was still living here.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.950
The boss? Just a second.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:08.500
Man, my head hurts.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.950
Hey, I'm coming in.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.870
Hey there, mister.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.870
Kenny, what the hell is with that outfit?

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:35.000
What? I always sleep like this.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.910
I can't sleep without my pajamas.

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:40.160
And this mess?

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.500
There was a party last night.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.830
And the man on the floor?

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.200
Um, no idea.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.040
Who is this guy?

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.790
Where the hell is O'Neill?

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:54.660
I can't find him...

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:58.950
Last I remembered, he drank
soda water mixed with vodka,

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:05.080
ketchup, and habanero sauce,
and was doing pelvic thrusts on the table...

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.120
Where did you get a goat?

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:19.700
I'm not sure. He wasn't here yesterday.

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:23.290
What a mess.

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:26.580
O'Neill isn't here.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.870
Maybe the goat ate him?

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:36.200
That's ridiculous.
I need him to check something for me.

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:38.580
Hey, get off me!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.620
Did I just hear...

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:52.200
Forgive me, Lord, for I am
within your blessings...

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:54.830
Where are you, O'Neill?

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:57.750
It hurts to breathe... It hurts so much...

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:00.950
I will drown within the flesh of your blessings

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:03.410
and come to you in your kingdom...

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.000
There you are.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.290
Hey, get off the man, lady.

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:11.700
I'm afraid that's impossible.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:15.200
When the Virgin Mary gets like this,
she won't wake up for at least 12 hours.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:17.700
The Virgin Mary? She's a prostitute, right?

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:20.200
Yes. But that's what they call her.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.160
Take this.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:45.290
Mister, that was mean.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:47.910
Well, I didn't think she'd react like that.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:51.290
Shouldn't we call an ambulance?

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.080
You're Tilarna, right?

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:02.580
It's not a dream, right?

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:07.410
The garbage truck! What happened to it?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.200
Oh, no!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.540
I need to chase after it!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.870
Are you coming too?

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:17.080
Okay!

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.200
First, let's find the garbage truck.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:27.410
It hasn't been that long,
so it should still be close.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:31.250
What? Did you find it?

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:44.330
"Lower the blinds. I won't be able
to keep living if someone sees me."

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:46.830
Jeez, we're in a hurry!

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:04.830
Let's hurry!

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:44.540
"Next time"
Next time on <i>COP CRAFT</i>.
